          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, right, Col. II",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the wife of \u1e62ema\u1e25 the parnas a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the house of Nu\u1e63ayr b. Th\u0101bit a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the son of al-Rif\u0101\u02be, the relative of the maker of vinegar sauce a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>Khal\u016bf of Jerba a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>Barak\u0101t RD al-GH[?] a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li><del>the parnas from Crete muqaddar</del></li>\n<li><del>the Aleppan who is (living) in (the synagogue of) the Iraqis a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</del></li>\n<li>Khalaf of Aleppo a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li><del>the proselyte (living) in the synagogue of the Iraqis a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</del></li>\n<li><del>b. </del>Natan the astrologer a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>Avraham the acquaintance of &ldquo;The Diadem&rdquo; a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the wife of b. \u1e24ash\u012bsh a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>bint al-Baghd\u0101d\u012b a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>&nbsp;the wife of al-N\u0101s j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>&nbsp;through Abu&rsquo;l-Faraj the parnas</li>\n<li>bint Sim\u1e25a the semi paralyzed woman a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the wife of ibn</li>\n<li>al-Kharr\u016bbiyya a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the daughter of ibn al-\u02bfAni a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>Umm \u1e24asan in the house</li>\n<li>of \u1e24ab\u012bsh a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the wife of Mufarrij the amputee a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the house of ibn Marw\u0101n a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the house of ibn \u02bfAz\u012bra a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li></ol>\n",
